  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in market and commercial expectations of transit disruptions through the Strait raises perceived geopolitical and operational risk for overseas projects, prompting institutional investors and corporate deal teams to pull back or delay cross-border technology financing and M&amp;A into China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">strait_of_hormuz</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
