  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater airspace safety risk raises freight and insurance costs and feeds into near‑term inflation and risk premia, leading markets to price higher short‑ and medium‑term interest rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
