  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A pronounced rise in airborne incidents and near‑misses linked to the Russo‑Ukrainian conflict elevates risk premia among traders and insurers for shipments transiting chokepoints, prompting immediate upward pressure on crude prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">strait_of_hormuz</data>
</edge>
