  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A higher systemic probability of airspace incidents raises insurance, logistics and regulatory compliance costs for cross‑border tech projects and M&amp;A, reducing willingness of firms and investors to commit cross‑border capital between US and PRC-linked entities.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-12 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
