  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising vulnerability of energy, logistics and port infrastructure increases the probability of supply shocks and near‑term inflation, prompting central banks to adopt a tighter monetary policy stance.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">monetary_currency_shift</data>
</edge>
