  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Demonstrated vulnerabilities of energy/logistics/port infrastructure to strikes increase perceived operational and supply‑chain risk for capital‑intensive advanced fabs, causing semiconductor firms and financiers to delay or scale back advanced‑node capacity expansions in higher‑risk jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
