  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter export controls escalate bilateral tensions and reduce political goodwill, making regional states and external powers less willing to engage in cooperative bargaining over transit rules and thereby slowing formal negotiation progress.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
