  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A tighter monetary policy raises corporate borrowing costs and the discount rate, causing firms to delay, downsize or cancel near-term AI and data‑center capex projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">monetary_currency_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
