  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Active, large-scale currency interventions that stabilize a volatile exchange rate reduce tail-risk perceptions and currency-driven earnings uncertainty for energy firms, thereby improving investor sentiment toward those issuers and markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">monetary_currency_shift</data>
