  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Larger unilateral FX market interventions (e.g., using FX reserves to defend a currency) deplete reserves and complicate cross‑border payments for foreign‑sourced interceptors and munitions, reducing short‑term procurement and lowering stock levels.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
